sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Lazy as LazyColumn (Ch 90)
    participant Paging as Paging 3 (Ch 71)
    participant Item as Item composable
    participant Coil as Coil (Ch 59)

    User->>Lazy: scroll down
    Lazy->>Lazy: recycle off-screen slots, compose NEWLY visible items only
    Lazy->>Paging: nearing end -> load next page (prefetch distance, Ch 71)
    Paging-->>Lazy: next page items (placeholders meanwhile)
    Lazy->>Item: compose item (stable key -> correct reuse, skippable -> cheap, Ch 90)
    Item->>Coil: AsyncImage(url) - decode OFF-MAIN, downsample, cache (Ch 59/89)
    Coil-->>Item: bitmap (async - never blocks the scroll frame)
    Item-->>User: frame within budget = smooth (Ch 90)
    Note over Coil: load CANCELLED if item recycled before it finishes
